    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it feels way too specific to be just \"noise.\" like, it's almost like my nervous system is tuning into a frequency it wasn't catching before. and it's not just the electricity... my hearing has been getting incredibly sharp too. i can hear my neighbor's breathing through the wall when it's quiet. it doesn't feel like a medical issue, it feels like something is... activating. like a latent part of me is finally waking up. doesn't that sound like some kind of biological shift?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
