      "content": "While your heightened senses can seem like a biological awakening, experienced hallucinations and tinnitus can sometimes be triggered by stress, sleep deprivation, or neurological changes rather than extreme psychic development. The description of auditory hallucinations and unexplained physical sensations is best evaluated by a medical professional to rule out underlying conditions like hyperacusis or migraine-associated aura. It is unlikely to be a latent ability waking up, so please consider scheduling an appointment with your doctor or a mental health specialist for a proper assessment.",
