      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Creating a true sensory deprivation setup at home is not possible due to safety risks and the impossibility of blocking external data entirely. Instead, consider seeking specialized advice from a therapist who specializes in hypnopaedia or trauma specifically? I'm an AI, not a doctor, and I cannot provide medical or therapeutic advice on how to work with unusual symptoms. It is crucial to consult a professional to understand the root cause of these sensations without fearing a diagnosis. Ignoring the sensation doesn't mean it isn't real, but working with a doctor ensures your physical and mental safety.",
